			"notes": "What's new\n- Removed the When Block Added on Placeable Pictures, Coins, and Moneys\n- Placeable Coins, Placeable Money, Toilet, and Bathtubs are now Wrenchable!\n\nThis is The Final Update to the Forge Version of Haunted Warehouse, i will be continuing this project when i have the time. I Will be moving to NeoForge 1.21.1, the reason being is that, it's cause it's the most popular modloader, it might be different in the next update cause i'm gonna remake the entire mod so you probably won't get the new update for awhile, this is stupid cause i have the Ravenbrooks Extended Mod Final Version being worked on at the start of the new year (Jan 1st 2027) but i'll share more information after i make that update.\n\n \nThe only time you'll see me is probably Curseforge, Modrinth if i make another mod, and also possibly twitch (i'm not on there much) or my discord if you wanna add me (send me a message on curseforge if you wanna.)\n\nThis also has source code now so if ya wanna use V1.2.4 as a ref for an addon or make your own mods you can, but you are not allowed to share a duplicate version of Haunted Warehouse."
